  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bigmuscles Nutrition Pvt Ltd vs Avijit Roy & Ors on 26 May, 2023 Author: Amit Bansal Bench: Amit Bansal $~16 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + Cs(Comm) 353/2023 Bigmuscles Nutrition Pvt Ltd .. Through: Mr.Darpan Wadh Advocate with Ms.A Ms.Sakshi Sharma, Ms.Anoushka Rajan, Bhadauria and Mr.A Advocates. versus Avijit Roy & Ors. Through: Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Amit Bansal Or % 26.05.2023 I.A. 10484/2023 (for exemption) 1.",
    "facts": "The authenticity of the order can be re-verified from Delhi High Court Order Portal by scanning the QR code shown above. In view of the urgent interim relief sought, the plaintiff is granted exemption from the requirement of pre-institution mediation in terms of Section 12A of the Commercial Courts Act, 2015. 7. The present application has been filed on behalf of the plaintiff seeking leave to file additional documents under the Commercial Courts Act, 2015. However, none appears for defendants no. 1, 3 and 5. The advance service could not be made on the defendant no.2 as the plaintiff did not have the email address.",
